exports[`Deutsch bleibt gleich - ohne Probe-Schalter > die Kapitelwahl > kapitelwahl 1`] = `"<div class="not-prose space-y-5"><div id="kp-live-task" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" class="sr-only"></div><div id="kp-live-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="sr-only"></div><div id="kp-live-alert" role="alert" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" class="sr-only"></div><div class="card p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-0.5" role="img" aria-label="Rang 1 — noch 100 XP bis zum nächsten." title="Rang 1 — noch 100 XP bis zum nächsten."><div class="relative" style="width: 46px; height: 46px;"><svg width="46" height="46" viewBox="0 0 46 46" class="-rotate-90"><circle cx="23" cy="23" r="21" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-hairline))" stroke-width="4"></circle><circle cx="23" cy="23" r="21" fill="none" stroke="rgb(var(--c-accent))" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="131.94689145077132" stroke-dashoffset="131.94689145077132" class="transition-all duration-500"></circle></svg><span class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-base font-bold text-ink">1</span></div><span class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted">Rang</span></div><span class="text-xs leading-tight text-ink-muted"><span role="img" title="0 XP — 2 je richtige Antwort, 30 je Kapitel." aria-label="0 XP — 2 je richtige Antwort, 30 je Kapitel.">0 XP</span><br><span role="img" title="0 von 183 Sternen — bis zu 3 je Kapitel." aria-label="0 von 183 Sternen — bis zu 3 je Kapitel.">0 ★</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 sm:ml-auto"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">63 Kapitel in 9 Klangwelten - alle frei wählbar</p></div></div></div><div class="card p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-keyshortcuts="Alt+U" class="btn-primary btn-toggle" title="Alle Klangwelten und Kapitel mit deinem Sterne-Stand (Alt + U)"><span aria-hidden="true">🗺</span> Kapitelwahl</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-keyshortcuts="Alt+L" class="btn-secondary btn-toggle" title="Liste aller Noten-Zeichen, sortiert nach deinem Lernweg (Alt + L)"><span aria-hidden="true">📖</span> Zeichenliste</button></div></div><div class="space-y-5"><h2 tabindex="-1" class="m-0 text-lg font-semibold text-ink outline-none">Kapitelwahl — such dir aus, was du üben willst</h2><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-mix-h"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><h3 id="kw-mix-h" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink"><span aria-hidden="true">🎲 </span>Tages-Mix</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Fünf Minuten bunt gemischt — Aufgaben quer durch deine gemeisterten Kapitel, ohne Sterne, nur zum Wachhalten.</p></div><p class="m-0 max-w-[16rem] text-xs text-ink-muted">Meistere erst ein paar Kapitel (mindestens 3), dann gibt es hier deinen Tages-Mix. Bisher: 0.</p></div></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-ohren"><h3 id="kw-h-ohren" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 1: Ohrenspitzer</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Erst hören, dann nachspielen: Puls, Tonhöhen, Klangfarben und Echo mit den Ohren fangen.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 8 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 24 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 1: Hoch oder tief? — Ohren auf</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 2: Klopf den Rhythmus</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 3: Puls-Fänger</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Lang oder kurz?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 5: Laut und leise</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 6: Welches Instrument?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 7: Echo-Spiel</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 8: Melodie-Memory</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-werkstatt"><h3 id="kw-h-werkstatt" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 2: Notenwerkstatt</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Noten, Werte, Pausen und Takt — die Grundzeichen der Braille-Noten.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 9