border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Formen hören</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-zusammenklang"><h3 id="kw-h-zusammenklang" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 6: Zusammenklang</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Zwei und mehr Töne zugleich: Intervalle hören und schreiben, Dur und Moll, zwei Stimmen in einer Zeile.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 6 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 18 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 1: Intervalle hören I</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 2: Intervalle in Braille</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 3: Intervalle hören II</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Dur oder Moll?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 5: Akkorde schreiben</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 6: Zwei Stimmen, eine Zeile</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-spielplatz"><h3 id="kw-h-spielplatz" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 7: Theorie-Spielplatz</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Tonleitern, Quintenzirkel, Diktate und eigene Takte — Musiktheorie zum Ausprobieren, mit Spielwiese und Komponier-Werkstatt.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 9 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 21 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 1: Tonleitern</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 2: Quintenzirkel-Rallye</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 3: Rhythmus-Diktat</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Melodie-Diktat</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 5: Fehler-Detektiv</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 6: Takt-Baumeister</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 7: Klang-Spielwiese</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">☐</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht besucht.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 8: Schluss-Sache</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 9: Komponier-Werkstatt</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">☐</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht besucht.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-instrumente"><h3 id="kw-h-instrumente" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 8: Instrumentenkunde</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Wie Instrumente notiert werden: Fingersatz, zwei Hände am Klavier, Singen mit Braille, Gitarre, Generalbass und der Aufbau einer Partitur.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 7 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 21 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 1: Fingersatz</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 2: Klaviermusik</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 3: Singen mit Braille</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Gitarre und Akkordsymbole</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 5: Generalbass und Stufen</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 6: Partitur und Druckbild</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 7: Bläser, Schlagwerk &amp; Co.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-buehne"><h3 id="kw-h-buehne" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 9: Lieder-Bühne</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Echte Lieder: anhören, in Braille lesen, mit Ausdruck spielen und aus dem Gedächtnis nachspielen.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 4 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 12 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 1: Lieder-Werkstatt</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 2: Lieder mit Ausdruck</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 3: Lese-Konzert</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Lieder-Quiz</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kp-badges-h"><h3 id="kp-badges-h" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Abzeichen</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">0 von 23 Abzeichen verdient — sammle Sterne, meistere Welten, schreib Diktate, bau Takte und spiel Lieder aus dem Gedächtnis.</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">⭐</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Sternschnuppe</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">5 Sterne gesammelt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🌟</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Sternen-Sammler</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">15 Sterne gesammelt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">✨</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Sternen-Fänger</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">30 Sterne gesammelt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🌌</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Sternenhimmel</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">60 Sterne gesammelt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🥉</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Erster Volltreffer</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Das erste Kapitel mit 3 Sternen gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🥈</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Bestnoten-Sammler</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">5 Kapitel mit 3 Sternen gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🥇</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Glanz-Musiker</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">15 Kapitel mit 3 Sternen gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🗺️</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Welten-Entdecker</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Eine ganze Klangwelt gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🧭</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Welten-Wanderer</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Drei Klangwelten gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">⛰️</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Welten-Bezwinger</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Sechs Klangwelten gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🏔️</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Meister aller Welten</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Alle neun Klangwelten gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">✍️</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Diktat-Detektiv</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">10 Diktate ohne Fehler geschrieben.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🕵️</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Diktat-Meister</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">50 Diktate ohne Fehler geschrieben.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🧱</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Takt-Maurer</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">10 volle Takte gebaut.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🏗️</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Takt-Architekt</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">50 volle Takte gebaut.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">📖</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Blatt-Leser</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">10 Zeilen fehlerfrei aus dem Gedächtnis gespielt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🎹</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Konzert-Leser</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">50 Zeilen fehlerfrei aus dem Gedächtnis gespielt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🎵</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Bühnen-Debüt</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Das erste Lied ganz durchgespielt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🎶</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Lieder-Liebhaber</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">9 verschiedene Lieder durchgespielt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🎤</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Bühnen-Star</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">18 verschiedene Lieder durchgespielt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">❓</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Geheim-Abzeichen</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Noch verschlossen — finde es heraus!</span></span><span class="sr-only">geheim, noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">❓</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Geheim-Abzeichen</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Noch verschlossen — finde es heraus!</span></span><span class="sr-only">geheim, noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">❓</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Geheim-Abzeichen</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Noch verschlossen — finde es heraus!</span></span><span class="sr-only">geheim, noch nicht verdient.</span></li></ul></section></div></div>"`;

