ffset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 7: Mit Gefühl! — im Lied</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-form"><h3 id="kw-h-form" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 5: Formenbau</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Wiederholungen, Volten und Formen — Braille kürzt schlau, das Ohr hört den Bauplan.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 4 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 12 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 1: Wiederholung und Form</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 2: Braille spart Arbeit</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 3: Volten, Da Capo und Segno</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Formen hören</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-zusammenklang"><h3 id="kw-h-zusammenklang" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 6: Zusammenklang</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Zwei und mehr Töne zugleich: Intervalle hören und schreiben, Dur und Moll, zwei Stimmen in einer Zeile.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 6 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 18 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 1: Intervalle hören I</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 2: Intervalle in Braille</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 3: Intervalle hören II</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Dur oder Moll?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 5: Akkorde schreiben</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 6: Zwei Stimmen, eine Zeile</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-spielplatz"><h3 id="kw-h-spielplatz" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 7: Theorie-Spielplatz</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Tonleitern, Quintenzirkel, Diktate und eigene Takte — Musiktheorie zum Ausprobieren, mit Spielwiese und Komponier-Werkstatt.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 9 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 21 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 1: Tonleitern</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 2: Quintenzirkel-Rallye</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 3: Rhythmus-Diktat</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 4: Melodie-Diktat</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 5: Fehler-Detektiv</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 6: Takt-Baumeister</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 7: Klang-Spielwiese</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">☐</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht besucht.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 8: Schluss-Sache</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 9: Komponier-Werkstatt</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">☐</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht besucht.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-instrumente"><h3 id="kw-h-instrumente" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 8: Instrumentenkunde</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Wie Instrumente notiert werden: Fingersatz, zwei Hände am Klavier, Singen mit Braille, Gitarre, Generalbass und der Aufbau einer Partitur.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 7 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 21 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-