 w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 5: Generalbass und Stufen</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 6: Partitur und Druckbild</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="card flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 border border-hairline bg-surface-raised px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-sm hover:bg-surface-sunken focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-[4.5px] focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent"><span class="font-medium text-ink">Kapitel 7: Bläser, Schlagwerk &amp; Co.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 tracking-wide text-amber-500">☆☆☆</span><span class="sr-only">— noch nicht gemeistert.</span></button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kw-h-buehne"><h3 id="kw-h-buehne" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Klangwelt 9: Lieder-Bühne</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">Echte Lieder: anhören, in Braille lesen, mit Ausdruck spielen und aus dem Gedächtnis nachspielen.</p><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">0 von 4 Kapiteln gemeistert · 0 von 12 Sternen</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><button type="but