/button></li></ul></section><section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="kp-badges-h"><h3 id="kp-badges-h" class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-ink">Abzeichen</h3><p class="m-0 mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">0 von 23 Abzeichen verdient — sammle Sterne, meistere Welten, schreib Diktate, bau Takte und spiel Lieder aus dem Gedächtnis.</p><ul class="m-0 mt-3 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">⭐</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Sternschnuppe</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">5 Sterne gesammelt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🌟</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Sternen-Sammler</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">15 Sterne gesammelt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">✨</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Sternen-Fänger</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">30 Sterne gesammelt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🌌</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Sternenhimmel</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">60 Sterne gesammelt.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🥉</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Erster Volltreffer</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Das erste Kapitel mit 3 Sternen gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🥈</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Bestnoten-Sammler</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">5 Kapitel mit 3 Sternen gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🥇</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Glanz-Musiker</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">15 Kapitel mit 3 Sternen gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🗺️</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Welten-Entdecker</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Eine ganze Klangwelt gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border px-3 py-2 border-hairline bg-surface-raised opacity-70"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-xl">🧭</span><span class="min-w-0 text-sm"><span class="block truncate font-medium text-ink">Welten-Wanderer</span><span class="block text-xs text-ink-muted">Drei Klangwelten gemeistert.</span></span><span class="sr-only">noch nicht verdient.</span